### FILES
page.html | HTML template with service list, modals for details/build/logs/check
page.js | JavaScript with ServicesPage object for API interaction

### FEATURES
- List all defined services with status
- Show service details and descriptor
- Build service images (local/remote/prebuilt modes)
- Deploy services to swarm
- View service logs
- Run service diagnostics

